        "en": "**The app cannot check this part.** For the writing, please use pen and paper. For the speaking, say it out loud and, if you can, practise with a native speaker or a teacher who can correct you.\n\n**Write (100–120 words).** Write a review of a film or a book: what it is about, what you thought of it and who you would recommend it to.\n\n**Speak (about 2 minutes).** Tell a friend aloud about the last film or series you saw, without revealing the ending."
